        <div class="unlock-content">
          <strong>Detailed Analytics</strong>
          <p>Extended session analytics in <code>/status</code> output</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3>What <code>/wrap</code> shows</h3>
    <p>After the Vibe Score coaching output, <code>/wrap</code> appends a progression summary:</p>

    <pre><code>--- Progression ---
Level 7 | 340/420 XP to Level 8
+10 (session) +38 (score bonus) +5 (test phase) = +53 XP
Skill: testing +15 XP (Level 2 -> Level 3)

--- New Badges ---
[BADGE] Shipper -- First feature shipped! (+50 XP)

*** LEVEL UP! Level 6 -> Level 7 "Focused Builder" ***
Unlocked: Weekly challenges, Skill tree in /achievements</code></pre>
  </section>

