  <!-- SKILL TREE -->
  <section class="section" id="skill-tree">
    <span class="section-label">Growth Tracking</span>
    <h2>Skill Tree</h2>
    <p>Five skill domains with 5 levels each. Skill XP is distributed automatically based on session metrics, giving you a visual fingerprint of your development strengths and weaknesses. Unlocks in <code>/achievements</code> at Level 5.</p>

    <h3>The five domains</h3>
    <TableWrap>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Skill</th><th>What It Measures</th><th>How XP Is Earned</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Prompting</strong></td>
            <td>Clear AI communication</td>
            <td>+10 for 0 churn sequences, +5 for score &ge;80, +5 for score &ge;90</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Architecture</strong></td>
            <td>Planning before building</td>
            <td>+5 for TDR complete, +5 for foundation complete, +10 for plan phase done</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Testing</strong></td>
            <td>Quality assurance</td>
            <td>+10 for tests passing, +5 for test phase done, +10 for coverage &gt;80%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Context Management</strong></td>
            <td>Token efficiency</td>
            <td>+15 for cache &gt;70%, +10 for peak context &lt;50%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
