  <!-- STREAKS -->
  <section class="section" id="streaks">
    <span class="section-label">Consistency</span>
    <h2>Streaks</h2>
    <p>Streaks track consecutive days of coding. They&rsquo;re designed to celebrate consistency without demanding it &mdash; a broken streak is just a number, not a loss.</p>

    <h3>How they work</h3>
    <div class="streak-rules">
      <div class="streak-rule">
        <div class="streak-icon">&#128197;</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Increments on <code>/wrap</code></strong>
          <p>Each calendar day you run <code>/wrap</code> counts. Multiple wraps per day still count as one.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="streak-rule">
        <div class="streak-icon">&#127774;</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Weekend auto-grace</strong>
          <p>Saturdays and Sundays never break streaks and never consume grace credits. Take weekends off freely.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="streak-rule">
        <div class="streak-icon">&#10052;</div>
        <div>
          <strong>2 grace days per month</strong>
          <p>Miss a weekday? The streak continues if you have grace days remaining. Resets on the 1st of each month.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="streak-rule">
        <div class="streak-icon">&#128154;</div>
        <div>
          <strong>No penalty for breaking</strong>
          <p>When a streak breaks, the counter resets to 0. No XP is lost, no badges are revoked. Start fresh.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="streak-rule">
        <div class="streak-icon">&#128276;</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Reminders are opt-in</strong>
          <p>Streak reminders are disabled by default. Enable via <code>/profile</code> (set gamification to &ldquo;All In&rdquo;) or in <code>config.json</code>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3>Streak data tracked</h3>
    <TableWrap>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Field</th><th>What It Stores</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>streak.current</code></td><td>Current consecutive day count</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>streak.longest</code></td><td>All-time longest streak (for bragging rights)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>streak.last_session_date</code></td><td>Last date <code>/wrap</code> was run</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>streak.grace_days_remaining</code></td><td>Grace credits left this month (0&ndash;2)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>streak.frozen_today</code></td><td>Whether a grace day was used today</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </TableWrap>
  </section>

