    <h3>How quizzes are triggered</h3>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Explicit:</strong> Run <code>/quiz</code> for a random quiz, or <code>/quiz context-management-101</code> for a specific one</li>
      <li><strong>Contextual:</strong> The Performance Coach suggests a relevant quiz after <code>/wrap</code> when it detects an anti-pattern (e.g., low cache &rarr; <code>context-management-101</code>)</li>
      <li><strong>Periodic:</strong> Session Startup suggests an overdue quiz if more than 30 days since the last one (never forces it)</li>
    </ol>

    <h3>XP from quizzes</h3>
    <p><strong>+5 XP per correct answer</strong>, awarded only on first completion. You can retake quizzes for practice but won&rsquo;t earn XP again. Quiz XP is intentionally modest &mdash; it cannot substitute for real work XP.</p>
