  <!-- PERFORMANCE COACH -->
  <section class="section" id="performance-coach">
    <span class="section-label">Self-Improvement</span>
    <h2>Performance Coach</h2>
    <p>The Performance Coach is an Opus agent that analyzes Vibe Score trends across sessions and proposes permanent improvements to your project&rsquo;s CLAUDE.md. It&rsquo;s the self-improving feedback loop at the heart of VibeCrew.</p>

    <h3>How it works</h3>
    <div class="coach-flow">
      <div class="coach-step">
        <div class="coach-num">1</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Detection</strong>
          <p>Reads the latest score file, extracts deduction patterns</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="coach-step">
        <div class="coach-num">2</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Correlation</strong>
          <p>Cross-references against MEMORY.md to find recurring patterns</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="coach-step">
        <div class="coach-num">3</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Eligibility</strong>
          <p>Validates against guardrails: min 5 sessions, no duplicates, not recently rejected</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="coach-step">
        <div class="coach-num">4</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Proposal</strong>
          <p>Generates a specific CLAUDE.md rule mutation targeting the highest-impact pattern</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="coach-step">
        <div class="coach-num">5</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Decision</strong>
          <p>You approve, reject, or edit the mutation. Rejections have a cooldown period</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="coach-step">
        <div class="coach-num">6</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Recording</strong>
          <p>Updates MEMORY.md and mutation-log.json for future analysis</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3>Guardrails</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Max 1 mutation per session</strong> &mdash; prevents overwhelming changes</li>
      <li><strong>Min 5 sessions</strong> required before any mutation is proposed</li>
      <li><strong>3-rejection cooldown:</strong> rejected patterns wait <code>rejection_count &times; 7 days</code> before being proposed again</li>
      <li><strong>No duplicate rules</strong> &mdash; won&rsquo;t propose what already exists in CLAUDE.md</li>
      <li><strong>No hook-redundant rules</strong> &mdash; won&rsquo;t propose rules that hooks already enforce</li>
      <li><strong>Max 15 Session Learnings</strong> in CLAUDE.md &mdash; auto-prunes oldest entries</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Pattern templates</h3>
    <p>The coach tracks six anti-pattern categories and generates targeted mutation proposals:</p>
    <TableWrap>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Pattern</th><th>Score Impact</th><th>Example Mutation</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Prompt Churn</td><td>&minus;5 per sequence</td><td>&ldquo;Write acceptance criteria before starting implementation&rdquo;</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Tool Loops</td><td>&minus;10 per loop</td><td>&ldquo;After 2 failed attempts, change approach instead of retrying&rdquo;</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Low Cache</td><td>&minus;15</td><td>&ldquo;Use Context7 for library docs instead of pasting them&rdquo;</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Context Violations</td><td>&minus;20</td><td>&ldquo;Offload research to worktree subagents&rdquo;</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Missing Artifacts</td><td>&minus;5</td><td>&ldquo;Always run /check before /wrap&rdquo;</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Documentation Drift</td><td>&minus;3 per doc</td><td>&ldquo;Update feature docs in the same session as code changes&rdquo;</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </TableWrap>
  </section>

